AutoTestStepMessage;;;;;EN- Continuity test in the Case.OttotestNewRowES- Prueba de continuidad en el Case.;;;;;;;;EN-Comunicate The Computer With eTechnicianOttotestNewRowOttotestNewRowES- Comunica la computadora con eTechnician;EN- Go to the TEMPERATURES section and see the parameterOttotestNewRowIntake Manifold Air Temp, OttotestNewRowAmbient Air Temperature,OttotestNewRowIntercooler Temperature sensor,OttotestNewRowExhaust Temperature &OttotestNewRowEngine Coolan Temp.OttotestNewRowOttotestNewRowES- Ir a la seccion TEMPERATURES y observar el parametro OttotestNewRowIntake Manifold Air Temp,OttotestNewRowAmbient Air Temperature ,OttotestNewRowIntercooler Temperature sensor,OttotestNewRowExhaust Temperature &OttotestNewRowEngine Coolan Temp.;;;;EN- Go to the FUEL DATA section and see The parameter "Engine Throttle Valve 1" & " Engine Fuel Delivery Pressure" .OttotestNewRowOttotestNewRowES-Ir a la seccion FUEL DATA y observar el parametro "Engine Throttle Valve 1" & " Engine Fuel Delivery Pressure" .;;EN- Go to the PRESSURE section and see the parameter "Engine Intake Manifold" , "Oil Pressure" & OttotestNewRow"DPF intake Pressure" .OttotestNewRowOttotestNewRowES- Ir a la seccion PRESSURES y observar el parametro "Engine Intake Manifold","Oil Pressure"&"DPF intake Pressure" .OttotestNewRow;;EN- Go to the FUEL DATA section and observe the parameter "APP-2"  & "APP-1 ".OttotestNewRowOttotestNewRowES- Vaya a la sección FUEL DATA y observe el parámetro "APP-2" y "APP-1;Wait 20 seconds with Battery and ignition in "OFF"OttotestNewRowThen disconnect PCM.OttotestNewRowEspere 20 segundos con la batería y el encendido en "OFF"OttotestNewRowLuego desconecte el PCM.
